    "details": {
      "description": "<p>Pistons positioned in the walls or floor. These pop out and strike creatures that enter a space adjacent (or on top of) them and strike them, moving them 5 feet (10 on a critical) and dealing bludgeoning damage.</p>",
      "disable": "<p>On a successful disable, the Hydraulic Piston is disabled.</p>\n<p>To disable the Hazard, 1 success is required on either a @Check[type:Athletics|dc:16|name:Disable Piston|traits:action:disable-a-device] (trained), @Check[type:crafting|dc:16|name:Psiton|traits:action:disable-a-device] (trained), or @Check[type:Theivery|dc:16|name:Disable Piston|traits:action:disable-a-device] (trained) check.</p>",
